CONCLUSION
Although it is considered an adjuvant therapy, case reports and series have demonstrated the viability of ITB
therapy as an effective option for patients with intractable
spasms due to SPS (3–7). This case report adds to the
growing evidence of successfully managed cases via
ITB therapy.
